  "visible_text": "--- Frame: root ---\nAUTOMATION ASSISTANT\nAssistant\nSupported target workflow: member lookup \u2192 account detail \u2192 current savings/checking balance.\nDemo members: 12345, 76821, 44002\nASSISTANT\nThe legacy application is ready. In the next phase this panel will route natural-language goals into discovery or deterministic replay.\nTRY A REQUEST\nLook up member 12345 and read their current savings balance\nWhat is member 76821's checking balance?\nNATURAL-LANGUAGE GOAL\nRun\nFUTURE EXECUTION PATH\nChat \u2192 capability router \u2192 discovery/replay \u2192 typed result\nTarget surface: nested iframes \u00b7 table layouts \u00b7 no test IDs\n\n--- Frame: legacy-app ---\nN Bank mock app\nCUCORE Online \u00b7 Release 8.4.12\n\tOperator: VJUJJAV Role: MEMBER SERVICE Branch: 001 Sign Off\n\n\nCUCORE MAIN MENU\nMEMBER\n\u203a\u00a0 Member Inquiry\n\u203a\u00a0 Account Maintenance\n\u203a\u00a0 Name / Address\nTRANSACTIONS\n\u203a\u00a0 Deposit / Withdrawal\n\u203a\u00a0 Transfer Funds\n\u203a\u00a0 History Inquiry\nOPERATIONS\n\u203a\u00a0 Teller Totals\n\u203a\u00a0 System Messages\nTERM WS-114\nSecure session\n\t\n\n--- Frame: legacy-app > workspace ---\nMember Inquiry \u2014 M1100\t\u25a1 \u25a1 \u00d7\nMEMBER SERVICES > MEMBER INQUIRY\nMember Number:\t\t\tEnter a member number, then select Find Member.\nTest condition:\t\nNormal processing\nMember not found\nPermission denied\nSlow response\nSession expired\nUnexpected verification dialog\nApplication error\nMember loaded.\nMEMBER PROFILE\nMember Name\tRiley Lee\tStatus\tActive\nMember Number\t13278\tMember Since\t2010-05-15\nPhone\t(555) 205-1005\tRelationship\tPremier\nEmail\triley.lee6@example.test\tMailing Area\tAustin, TX\nSHARE / DRAFT ACCOUNTS\nType\tSuffix\tDescription\tStatus\tLast Activity\tAction\nSAV\t01\tRegular Savings\tActive\t2026-08-09\tView\nDDA\t10\tEveryday Checking\tActive\t2026-08-03\tView\nHost: CUCORE-PROD-02Tran: M1100\nF1=Help \u00a0 F3=Exit \u00a0 F9=Search",
